{"id":2219,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>2026 年 4 月 27 日，由中北大学能源与动力工程学院、航空宇航学院联合承办的中北大讲堂专题讲座在图书馆学术报告厅举行。广州市正骨医院院长、广州中医药大学黄熙谋教授应邀主讲，聚焦阴阳循经诊疗与青少年神经性抑郁症防治，开展中西医结合心理健康科普。</p></div><div></div><div><p>黄熙谋教授为全国基层名老中医药专家，独创阴阳循经诊疗体系，融合中医经络与现代神经解剖知识，以非手术方式实现筋骨同调、心身同治，已广泛应用于青少年情绪问题早期干预。讲座中，他结合病例分析青少年身心问题成因，讲解中医形神合一理念，现场示范循经保健手法，并细致解答师生提问，分享中医药传承与校园推广经验。</p></div><div></div><div><p>此次讲座推动中医药文化进校园、促进跨学科融合。学院表示，将持续依托中北大讲堂普及健康知识，助力师生树立科学健康理念，护航学子身心健康与全面发展。</p></div><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7Uz7VbUmM7nRfkn2RL4MN-8Ll7bnRLdsoR9bUlUZMmCZnml0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYM1ybLky4MNLYL7W2UNWfU4nRoRLZnmVkU49iU4vZMmAFnNCaUml8LRAFLzNbol-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZM4vJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9877&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8269036C20BFBBAC4C838F1BC85C7868/FF0B5408/1999B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7Uz7VbUmM7nRfkn2RL4MN-8Ll7bnRLdsoR9bUlUZMmCZnml0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYM1ybLky4MNLYL7W2UNWfU4nRoRLZnmVkU49iU4vZMmAFnNCaUml8LRAFLzNbol-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZM4vJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9877&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7o77V4ol-sMzTkL27CiUlLYL7QRoRTd7Ml-DU4n2ozVkozv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLYyDM1yZMmUDnNUsL8V2MlrRMN-8LzCiMm7iolWkoRMFMlWVnzARU4nFLzCaozCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZM4vJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9877&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC3668646FD73AF5EC6B41656159BB83/5BEE8CC4/16096\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7o77V4ol-sMzTkL27CiUlLYL7QRoRTd7Ml-DU4n2ozVkozv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLYyDM1yZMmUDnNUsL8V2MlrRMN-8LzCiMm7iolWkoRMFMlWVnzARU4nFLzCaozCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZM4vJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9877&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7L87VsolMknNr2L2RQ2M4C8Uzn2olldiUlMfnRWVU49bnmG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7LShkM1h7UzL4UNU4MR6RU4QfnN7ZUNCbMmMRUm6VMmTFnRUDLmlbU4QFLlUaoR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NZM4vJqd-nx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9877&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9D1B6DA3